Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.00,0:11:29.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ал, кеттік.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.93,0:11:31.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Хаха…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.50,0:11:35.37,Rubi,,0000,0000,0000,,Мақсат
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.50,0:11:35.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《Сол бет...
